{"id":"6b18750fb01771e3","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-sigma3-representation.md","title":"Σ₃ 集合的有限行／满行表示","display":"thm-sigma3-representation — Σ₃ 集合的有限行／满行表示","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-sigma3-representation","aliases":["20-thm-sigma3-representation"],"display":"thm-sigma3-representation — Σ₃ 集合的有限行／满行表示","chapter":"4","section":"4.3.5","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 4.3.9（完整行性质）","source_printed_pages":[90],"source_pdf_pages":[126],"depends_on":["[[20-df-arith]]","[[20-df-re]]","[[20-thm-cof-complexity]]","[[20-thm-smn]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-sigma3-representation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-sigma3-representation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-sigma3-representation — Σ₃ 集合的有限行／满行表示"},{"key":"chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"section","html":"4.3.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 4.3.9（完整行性质）"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>126</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"832f53dc90c8947a\" href=\"?note=832f53dc90c8947a\" title=\"20-df-arith\">20-df-arith</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1e47661fa15be194\" href=\"?note=1e47661fa15be194\" title=\"20-thm-cof-complexity\">20-thm-cof-complexity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\Sigma_3^0\">\\(S\\in\\Sigma_3^0\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"832f53dc90c8947a\" href=\"?note=832f53dc90c8947a\" title=\"20-df-arith\">20-df-arith</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1e47661fa15be194\" href=\"?note=1e47661fa15be194\" title=\"20-thm-cof-complexity\">20-thm-cof-complexity</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sigma3-representation}\\vdash\n\\exists g:\\omega^2\\to\\omega\\ \\left[\\begin{gathered}\ng\\in\\mathcal C_2\\land\\operatorname{dom}(g)=\\omega^2\\land\n\\forall x,y\\ (|W_{g(x,y)}|&lt;\\omega\\lor W_{g(x,y)}=\\omega),\\\\\n\\forall x\\ [x\\in S\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists N\\ \\forall y\\ge N\\ W_{g(x,y)}=\\omega],\\\\\n\\forall x\\ [x\\notin S\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall y\\ |W_{g(x,y)}|&lt;\\omega]\n\\end{gathered}\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sigma3-representation}\\vdash\n\\exists g:\\omega^2\\to\\omega\\ \\left[\\begin{gathered}\ng\\in\\mathcal C_2\\land\\operatorname{dom}(g)=\\omega^2\\land\n\\forall x,y\\ (|W_{g(x,y)}|&lt;\\omega\\lor W_{g(x,y)}=\\omega),\\\\\n\\forall x\\ [x\\in S\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists N\\ \\forall y\\ge N\\ W_{g(x,y)}=\\omega],\\\\\n\\forall x\\ [x\\notin S\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall y\\ |W_{g(x,y)}|&lt;\\omega]\n\\end{gathered}\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>用 Cof 完全性取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in S\">\\(x\\in S\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_{f(x)}\">\\(W_{f(x)}\\)</span> 余有限。统一枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_{g(x,y)}=\\{z:\\forall u\\ (y\\le u\\le z\\Rightarrow u\\in W_{f(x)})\\}\">\\(W_{g(x,y)}=\\{z:\\forall u\\ (y\\le u\\le z\\Rightarrow u\\in W_{f(x)})\\}\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[y,\\infty)\">\\([y,\\infty)\\)</span> 没有缺口，整行为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>；否则在首个缺口处截断，为有限集合（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z&lt;y\">\\(z&lt;y\\)</span> 的条件为空真）。余有限时超过最后缺口的每行都满；余无限时每行有限。新增的有限／满行条件是唯一行表示实际需要的契约。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 4.3.9（完整行性质）；印刷页 90；PDF 第 126 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-arith","status":"resolved","id":"832f53dc90c8947a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-arith]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-cof-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"1e47661fa15be194","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-cof-complexity]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-arith","status":"resolved","id":"832f