-thm-sigma3-representation]]；see [[20-df-ext]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-lem-padding]]。"},{"id":"cf3112cb2fc40702","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-sigma3-representation]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。"}],"outgoing":["832f53dc90c8947a","60af447f5d59a8dc","1e47661fa15be194","8ba6597a854c206f"]}